@rem Copy this file to Start.local.bat to apply settings that only make sense on your machine.
@rem Start.local.bat is not tracked by git and is kept when you update Hearth.
@rem
@rem Example: send Hearth's outbound requests through a local proxy (needs Node.js 24.5 or newer).
@rem set "HTTP_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:10808"
@rem set "HTTPS_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:10808"
@rem set "NO_PROXY=localhost,127.0.0.1,::1,[::1]"
@rem
@rem Example: use another port.
@rem set "HEARTH_PORT=8731"
